Adapted from examples/cfd/stokes_mgn at commit
b45a5c810c741e6b41f8515be24c51121f8fc21f:

  configs/official.yaml       from conf/config.yaml (keys and values kept, path keys replaced; keys added below a marker)
  src/stokes_ft/model.py      MeshGraphNet construction from train.py
  src/stokes_ft/engine.py     training loop from train.py, test prediction from inference.py
  src/stokes_ft/finetune.py   Stokes, DNN, FourierDNN (unchanged) and PhysicsInformedFineTuner from pi_fine_tuning.py
  src/stokes_ft/data.py       train/validation/test split from preprocess.py, .vtp reader from utils.py

Each of these files carries the original NVIDIA copyright and licence header and
a statement of the changes. MeshGraphNet, StokesDataset, PhysicsInformer, the
derivative operators and the checkpoint utilities are imported from the
PhysicsNeMo package and are not copied.

The dataset (PhysicsNeMo Datasets: Stokes Flow, NVIDIA NGC) is downloaded by
scripts/prepare_data.py and is not redistributed here.
